FUEL Game-Changer Award — Fulfilling Our Client Promise

I am pleased to recognize her exceptional contributions, strong ownership, and commitment to delivering meaningful value to the client through the modernization of ArcMap and her significant contributions to GeoApps and AT app. Her work has gone beyond individual project deliverables, helping strengthen the company’s geospatial capabilities and establishing a sustainable foundation for future business needs.

One of her most significant achievements has been playing a key role in modernizing ArcMap, a critical geospatial library used across the company. In the railroad industry, geospatial technology plays an important role in understanding the location of assets, monitoring infrastructure, visualizing operational information, and supporting informed business decisions. Recognizing the importance of this shared capability, she contributed to transforming an aging technology foundation into a modern, scalable, and reusable solution that supports applications throughout the company.

What makes this achievement particularly impactful is that ArcMap is not limited to a single application. It serves as a common geospatial foundation for multiple business applications, including GeoApps and AT app. By modernizing this shared library, she helped create long-term value across the organization, enabling greater consistency, reducing duplicate development efforts, simplifying future enhancements, and supporting the company’s evolving business requirements. The impact of this initiative extends well beyond one project, benefiting multiple teams and applications that depend on geographic information.

Her contributions to GeoApps further demonstrate exceptional ownership and delivery commitment. Among the three user interfaces developed as part of the initiative, she took responsibility for approximately 95% of the development of one interface, leveraging the modernized ArcMap library to deliver an integrated and user-focused solution. This demonstrated how the shared geospatial foundation could be successfully adopted within a business application, bringing modernization efforts closer to real operational needs.

She also made valuable contributions to AT app, supporting improvements in geographic visualization, application usability, and the overall user experience. Her involvement across these initiatives demonstrates her ability to manage multiple responsibilities while maintaining a strong focus on quality, client expectations, and successful delivery.

Beyond her direct project responsibilities, she has consistently demonstrated a willingness to go the extra mile by supporting other application teams, addressing complex challenges, sharing knowledge, and collaborating closely with client stakeholders. Her proactive approach to resolving issues at the shared-library level has helped create solutions that can benefit multiple applications rather than addressing problems in isolation. This reflects her commitment to the broader success of the client engagement.

What truly sets her apart is her ability to connect technology transformation with long-term business value. Rather than focusing solely on completing assigned tasks, she has contributed to strengthening an enterprise-wide capability that supports the company’s geospatial needs. Her efforts have helped establish a more reliable and maintainable foundation, improve consistency across applications, and enable development teams to respond more effectively to future business demands.

Her contributions reflect strong accountability, technical leadership, collaboration, and a genuine commitment to client success. By modernizing a critical enterprise-wide library, taking significant ownership of GeoApps delivery, contributing to AT app, and supporting teams beyond her assigned responsibilities, she has demonstrated the initiative and dedication that define a true game-changer.

Her continued focus on delivering quality, creating lasting business value, and exceeding expectations strongly embodies the spirit of Fulfilling Our Client Promise, making her a deserving candidate for the FUEL Game-Changer Award.

